### AI Assistance

ChatGPT suggested improvements to the structure and wording of the document, including clarification of the GitHub workflow, Pull Request process, AI logging requirements, and the requirement to maintain 15 user stories.

### Action Taken

**Modified**

I reviewed the AI-generated suggestions and modified the content to match the CareerConnect project, our team's responsibilities, and the requirements for SOEN 341.

### Validation

The Team Process document was reviewed by me before being added to the GitHub repository. I verified that the responsibilities, GitHub workflow, AI logging process, and Sprint 1 requirements reflect our team's planned process.

